 R←Test_SendEmail_30(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text;addresses
⍝ Send an email to a dozen CCs: one RCPT TO each, and a folded CC header
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 addresses←{'john.doe+',(⍕⍵),'@example.com'}¨⍳12
 parms.CC←⊃{⍺,',',⍵}/addresses
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf 13=+/'RCPT TO:'∘≡¨8↑¨∆SERVER.Commands
 →T.PassesIf∧/78≥≢¨∆HeaderLines text
 →T.PassesIf(⊃{⍺,', ',⍵}/'<',¨addresses,¨'>')≡text ∆Header'CC'

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
